  (text "03 / REAL SENSOR CONNECTIONS\nB2 HuskyLens SEN0305: camera over the conveyor, I2C 0x32 -> A4/A5.\nB1 E18-D80NK: 5V photoeye -> D4, internal pull-up. B3 HC-SR04: D11 TRIG / A3 ECHO.\nB4 SEN0193: analogue A0; relative moisture proxy only, NOT calibrated grain %.\nB6 DS18B20: A2 OneWire + R6 4.7k; B5 full-bridge load cell -> HX711 D12/D13." (at 25.4 133.35 0) (effects (font (size 1.85 1.85)) (justify left)) (uuid "3ea0d18f-7e67-4184-95bc-32857b5627a5"))
  (text "HOW THE LINE WORKS / REQUIRED FIRMWARE\nSTART checks safety, hopper level, learned camera inspection and calibrated temperature/moisture limits.\nStart conveyor M2 + sifter M4 first; their auxiliaries energise KT1; after 3s it permits grinder M1.\nDetect and clamp bag; tare HX711, open Y1 and run M3 auger. Stop auger and close gate at target weight.\nSTOP removes feed/auger commands; optional 5s belt/sifter clean-out. E-stop immediately removes coil power.\nFaults latch: overload/run-feedback loss/temperature/sensor timeout. Manual restart; green RUN, amber READY, red 1Hz FAULT + buzzer.\nRelay inputs ACTIVE LOW: HIGH = OFF; RP1-5 pull-ups and startup-HIGH prevent boot pickup. Wi-Fi never bypasses local safety.\nSEN0193 / HC-SR04 / HuskyLens are prototype sensors: dust enclosure, calibration, latency and fail-safe behaviour need validation." (at 25.4 526 0) (effects (font (size 1.85 1.85)) (justify left)) (uuid "acd55f81-c087-48ca-8688-66748cf94883"))
  (text "SUPPLY LEGEND\nFIELD_24V_RAW / FIELD_0V: POWER PS1 -> control / contactor coils.\nFIELD_24V_SAFE: SR1 switched coil feed; never supplied by Arduino.\nARDUINO_9V / LOGIC_GND: isolated POWER PS2 -> UNO VIN and PS3/PS4.\nPS3 = 3.3V Wi-Fi; PS4 = 5V peripherals/relays. UNO 5V output is unused.\nPWR_FLAG marks an actual supplied net for single-page ERC; it is not a component." (at 619.76 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.75 1.75)) (justify left)) (uuid "2106aed1-cbaf-49ca-b9f1-b95c0dc55c0b"))
